<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers raised its rating of Adtran Inc to buy from neutral, according to a source.</p>
<p>-- Adtran shares were up two to 39 in early trading on Monday.</p>
</text>
